// 'Crossroads' Production Model (enemy_1331_cbsisy) and Prototype (enemy_1331_cbsisy_2): laser vehicles with no
// ordinary attack (an empty Combat).
// - AttackTrigger: a permanent enemy_cbsisy_t buff with UNBALANCE_IMMUNE (abnormal flag 8) that triggers every 1 s, the
//   first at once. Each trigger casts CloseAttack (every ground operator within the 0.7 Selecter collider, Arts,
//   attack@CloseAttack x ATK) and FourDirAttackMove/Idle (by IfEnemyIsMovingBySelf): four projectile_enemy_cbsisy lasers
//   along the cardinal directions (speed 6, life 0.2, radius 0.2, one hit, ground or aerial), Arts,
//   attack@FourDirAttack x ATK. Both wait for the next OnAttack event of the looping Move (1 s: 0.2, 0.7) or Idle
//   (0.5 s: 0.2) clip; preDelay 3 caps the wait. The interrupt buffs end each cast once it has fired.
// - The Ristar abilities (AntiRistar, RistarSpeedDown, the *ForRistar casts, enemy_cbsisy_t_2, enemy_cbsisy_move_ristar)
//   only act on Planetary Debris (tile_ristar_road); no published stage has debris yet.
// Every component reachable from the retained abilities, the templates and both projectiles are pinned below with
// local references reduced to null/local; the variants differ only in their skeleton.
